[0.091, "o", "y"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b[2;72H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m2\u001b[4;26H"]
[0.000, "o", "                                               \u001b[5;26H  Four be the things I'd been better without:  \u001b[6;26H"]
[0.000, "o", "  Love, curiosity, freckles and doubt.         \u001b[7;26H"]
[0.000, "o", "                                               \u001b[8;26H  -- Dorothy Parker, \"Inventory\"               \u001b[9;26H"]
[0.000, "o", "                                               \r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mYou are carrying:\u001b[25;3H"]
[0.000, "o", "a chocolate biscuit\u001b[26;3H"]
[0.000, "o", "an electric torch (providing light and closed)\u001b[27;3Ha crumpled piece of paper\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.405, "o", "r"]
[0.090, "o", "e"]
[0.090, "o", "a"]
[0.091, "o", "d"]
[0.090, "o", " "]
[0.090, "o", "p"]
[0.090, "o", "a"]
[0.091, "o", "p"]
[0.090, "o", "e"]
[0.090, "o", "r"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[8M\u001b[2;72H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m3\u001b[22;4H\u001b(B\u001b[mThings to do:\u001b[24;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "1. Find map\u001b[25;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "2. Phone airport to check parking\u001b[26;4H"]
[0.000, "o", "3. Health forms...\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "and so on. Let's face it, 1. is more enticing than the rest put together.\r\u001b[30d>"]
