[0.000, "o", "\u001b[14M\u001b[H\u001b[C"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mOld Winery\u001b[2;72H"]
[0.000, "o", "5\r\u001b[18d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mOld Winery\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mThis small cavity at the north end of the attic once housed all manner of home-made wine\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "paraphernalia, now lost and unlamented. Steps, provided with a good strong banister rail, lead down\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "and to the west, and the banister rail continues along a passage east.\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "You can see a labelled glass demijohn (which is closed) (in which are a nasty-looking red battery\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "and a tourist map) here.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "As you disturb the still air, the attic key, which was balanced on top of the demijohn, slips onto\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "the floor and disappears into a crack in the floorboards. Your spirits sink as it does, rattling\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "down some distance. How on earth are you going to get it back?\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.405, "o", "l"]
