[0.000, "o", "and to the west, and the banister rail continues along a passage east.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "You can see a labelled glass demijohn (which is closed) (in which are a nasty-looking red battery\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "and a tourist map) here.\r\u001b[30d>"]
